        "original_id": "62821ea5-f92c-57ac-86ee-c539fd5bd7e5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: American Foxhound, English Foxhound, Löwchen, Little Lion Dog, Trigg Hound, Trigg Foxhound, Hayden Trigg Hound\n- People: Colonel Haiden Trigg\n- Places: Kentucky\n- Concepts: dog breeds, dog varieties\n\nFacts:\n- The American Foxhound is a breed of dog and is a cousin of the English Foxhound.\n- The Löwchen, also called the Little Lion Dog, is a breed of dog.\n- The Trigg Hound, also known as the Trigg Foxhound or Hayden Trigg Hound, is a variety of the American Foxhound.\n- Colonel Haiden Trigg developed the Trigg Hound in Kentucky.",
